<title>USA: Barr Laboratories names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Barr Laboratories names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, N.Y. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Laboratories Inc said Monday that it had appointed it treasurer, William McKee, as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Barr Laboratories said McKee joined the company last year as director of finance and was named treasurer in March.  </p>
<p>McKee replaces Paul Bisaro, who has been promoted to senior vice president of strategic business development, the company said.</p>
